# items.json is NOT ignored. It is the handoff between GitHub Actions
# (which can reach the internet) and the Claude routine (which cannot).
# It has to be committed, or the routine has nothing to read.

# working files, regenerated every run
themes.json
brief.html
__pycache__/
*.log

# briefs/ is NOT ignored either, and that is the point. brief.html above is
# the scratch copy at the repo root, overwritten daily. briefs/<date>.html is
# the archived copy, written only after the email sends. Same bytes, opposite
# lifetimes: one is a working file, the other is the record.
